    - target: {fileID: 585750043858291742, guid: 885f84cff93c04c4a87f33457bef17c0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.name
      value: Mr. Meowzers
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 585750043858291742, guid: 885f84cff93c04c4a87f33457bef17c0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 585750043858291742, guid: 885f84cff93c04c4a87f33457bef17c0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: Based on my calculations.... Oh hey! I didn't see you there, I was just
        thinking.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 585750043858291742, guid: 885f84cff93c04c4a87f33457bef17c0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: Bob told you about the sun? It's weird, I've never seen anything like
        it before. I don't want to get into spiritual things but science does not
        seem to explain this.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 585750043858291742, guid: 885f84cff93c04c4a87f33457bef17c0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'Since you''re here, could you help gather some materials for me? I''ll
        pay you handsomely. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 585750043858291742, guid: 885f84cff93c04c4a87f33457bef17c0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: In the woods there are some mushrooms that give me incredible insight.
        Go collect 3 of them for me and return back to me. I might even let you keep
        a few.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
